<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Amiga tender for 18,000 T maize.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Amiga tender for 18,000 T maize.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission said it has accepted the tender of Amiga International Plc for the supply of 18,000 tonnes of maize at $132.75 per tonne.</p>
<p>The grain commission said in an statement prices were C &amp; F. Shipment is scheduled out of Limassol port in November or December 1996.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
